{"#":"SYNTHESISED. Commodity .NET RAT (Quasar/AsyncRAT class) dropped into AppData under a Microsoft-sounding name, loading its core module, opening a control pipe, persisting, then beaconing to one host roughly every 30 s with a small amount of jitter."}
